---
const ctaLink = 'https://buy.stripe.com/5kQbJ0dLS5IN1DhenSgMw02';
---

<section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-primary-dark to-primary relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white/50 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] border border-white/10 rounded-full"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] border border-white/10 rounded-full"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile sm:px-margin-desktop relative z-10 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-6">
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-white rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="font-label-sm">Consulta disponible</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      ¿Listo para comenzar tu camino?
    </h2>
    <p class="font-body-lg text-white/80 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      No dejes tu futuro, tu familia o tus negocios en manos de la improvisación. Diseñemos juntos la ruta migratoria y corporativa ideal para ti.
    </p>
    <a 
      href={ctaLink}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-secondary px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-headline-md text-headline-md font-semibold shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 active:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <span>Agenda tu Consultoría Estratégica Aquí</span>
      <i class="ph ph-arrow-right text-xl transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2"></i>
    </a>
    <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center gap-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/70">
        <i class="ph ph-shield-check text-xl"></i>
        <span class="font-label-sm">Asesoría 100% Confidencial</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/70">
        <i class="ph ph-clock text-xl"></i>
        <span class="font-label-sm">Respuesta en 24 horas</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>